ability Science"},{"text":"Hydrology"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Possible international career directions include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Climate Data Scientist"},{"text":"Climate Modeller"},{"text":"Climate Risk Analyst"},{"text":"Earth Observation Scientist"},{"text":"Environmental Data Scientist"},{"text":"Climate Researcher"},{"text":"Sustainability Data Scientist"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For overseas programs, check the current university's mathematics, programming, physics, statistics and prerequisite-credit requirements before applying."}]},{"heading":"Career progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Analytics route"},{"type":"h","text":"B.Sc"},{"type":"h","text":"Junior Climate Data Analyst"},{"type":"h","text":"Climate Data Analyst"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior Climate Data Analyst"},{"type":"h","text":"Climate Data Scientist / Climate Risk Specialist"},{"type":"h","text":"Lead Climate Analytics / Climate Intelligence"},{"type":"h","text":"Research route"},{"type":"h","text":"B.Sc"},{"type":"h","text":"M.Sc"},{"type":"h","text":"Research Assistant"},{"type":"h","text":"PhD"},{"type":"h","text":"Climate Scientist / Research Scientist"},{"type":"h","text":"Consulting route"},{"type":"h","text":"B.Sc"},{"type":"h","text":"Environmental/Climate Analyst"},{"type":"h","text":"Climate Consultant"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior Climate Consultant"},{"type":"h","text":"Climate Strategy / Risk Lead"}]},{"heading":"PhD / research directions","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Potential research areas include:"},{"type":"h","text":"Climate modelling"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Regional climate modelling"},{"text":"Climate projections"},{"text":"Downscaling"},{"text":"Extreme-event modelling"},{"text":"Climate uncertainty"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Climate impacts"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Agriculture"},{"text":"Water resources"},{"text":"Public health"},{"text":"Urban systems"},{"text":"Coastal systems"},{"text":"Biodiversity"